      "content": "Thanks. It's a decent start, but it feels a bit too surface-level. I need more depth on the actual friction points. \n\nSpecifically, talk about the increased frequency of close-quarters encounters and the direct buildup of militarized outposts. Be very direct about the risk of a kinetic clash. I'm slightly worried that if we get too \"heavy\" on the conflict details, the automated sentiment score will tank and my supervisor will flag it as too aggressive, but I need the raw facts. Just try to stay professional while being blunt about the danger.",
